    "font" : "LMRoman10-Italic",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Corollary 1.3. Let θ ∈ (0, π2]; then every pair of continuous disjoint periodic curves in the plane inscribes a rectangle with angle θ between its two diagonals."
  }, {
