    "font" : "LMRoman10-Regular",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "We conjecture that Theorem 1.2 is optimal, in the following sense."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 25,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 69.858, 540.015, 94.133 ],
    "font" : "LMRoman10-Italic",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Conjecture 1.4. Let Q be a quadrilateral that admits an inscription in any pair of disjoint periodic curves in C. Then Q is an isosceles trapezoid."
